{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Street Food Legend is a simulation game about night market life and the stories of ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a regular office worker, you decide to start a street food stall and meet a kind-hearted girl. Seeing you're a novice, she helps attract customers by cosplaying in &quot;Guochao&quot; (Modern Chinese) style. You hit it off immediately\u2014and thus begins your legendary journey of grilled noodles and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast cooking: the quicker the hands, the bigger the profit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of cooking, every second counts: crack the egg, brush the sauce, flip, and serve. In a heartbeat, the aroma fills the air amidst the rising steam. It\u2019s a moment of pure, intense focus\u2014much like those split-seconds in real life where there's no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ed2fda6f247099fe9c377795b91027e8.poster.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ed2fda6f247099fe9c377795b91027e8.webm?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ed2fda6f247099fe9c377795b91027e8.mp4?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Customers: Diverse &amp; Eccentric!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On these busy streets, you\u2019ll always encounter quirky characters with strange habits. Pay close attention to their odd requests and serve them at lightning speed\u2014you might just earn their help in return!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ffd771a5149c55542b7798d94079581e.poster.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ffd771a5149c55542b7798d94079581e.webm?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/ffd771a5149c55542b7798d94079581e.mp4?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chinese Style Snacks: Combo for Cash!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about the noodles! Iced black tea, grilled sausages, fried chicken cutlets\u2014get them all on the menu! More snacks, more income. Your status as a &quot;Legend&quot; is just within reach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/566c984e0c447315bd1781ac3045714d.poster.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/566c984e0c447315bd1781ac3045714d.webm?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/566c984e0c447315bd1781ac3045714d.mp4?t=1772764543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Street Stories, Human Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The joy of a simple snack and a warm greeting is enough to brighten any ordinary day. Life is truly worth living\u2014it\u2019s hidden in the rising steam of your noodles and in the &quot;legendary&quot; stories of everyday people finding happiness in the little things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/5fde47756188dfdfe1ad8d1044d6249d.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/8d698fa52ef3c60f8a681ab3b74ce3ee.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/extras/933007a75e6c0c3c6932d6f3474559ba.avif?t=1772764543\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584920?t=1772764543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/4624c6e5e25983389e2a10754920422db53fa613/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772764543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/d37c7c351601545814cce870b5f30721f17989d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772764543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584920/d37c7c351601545814cce870b5f30721f17989d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772764543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4001170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Street Food Legend is a simulation game about night market life and the stories of ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a regular office worker, you decide to start a street food stall and meet a kind-hearted girl. Seeing you're a novice, she helps attract customers by cosplaying in &quot;Guochao&quot; (Modern Chinese) style. You hit it off immediately\u2014and thus begins your legendary journey of grilled noodles and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><str