/steam/apps/3584920/b1abb521c175355d23567a733b8af47a2ca97632/ss_b1abb521c175355d23567a733b8af47a2ca97632.600x338.jpg?t=1772764543"}],"short_description":"A heartfelt game where you run a night market stall, cooking kaolengmian (grilled cold noodles). Customers come and go, stopping by to chat and share bits of their lives, joys, frustrations, and everyday struggles. At this little stall, you cook, listen, and keep living an ordinary person\u2019s life.","steam_appid":3584920,"support_info":{"email":"hohogamedev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}